<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH CHAMPIONSHIP LEADING SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH CHAMPIONSHIP LEADING SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the Spanish first division after Sunday's games:</p>
<p>32 - Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>25 - Alfonso Perez (Real Betis)</p>
<p>21 - Davor Suker (Real Madrid), Rivaldo (Deportivo Coruna)</p>
<p>19 - Raul Gonzalez (Real Madrid), Oli Alvarez (Oviedo)</p>
<p>16 - Ismael Urzaiz (Athletic Bilbao), Victor Fernandez</p>
<p>(Valladolid)</p>
<p>15 - Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao), Luis Enrique Martinez</p>
<p>(Barcelona)</p>
<p>14 - Julen Guerrero (Athletic Bilbao), Christopher Ohen</p>
<p>(Compostela), Lyuboslav Penev (Compostela), Manuel Alfaro</p>
<p>(Hercules)</p>
